## Domain-Specific Validation Examples

Use these consistently across bootstrap, DNS, teardown, and runbooks:

```bash
# DNS resolution
dig +short boutique.biroltilki.art
dig +short argocd.boutique.biroltilki.art

# HTTPS health (expect HTTP/2 200 or 302)
curl -I https://boutique.biroltilki.art
curl -I https://argocd.boutique.biroltilki.art
```

**Expected DNS:** A record pointing to Terraform-managed static global IP.

**Expected HTTPS:** Valid TLS certificate (Google-managed); `curl -I` returns `HTTP/2 200` or `302` without certificate errors.

